otentially limiting the scope of its claimed superiority.", "The interpretability of neuron activation features, while highlighted, is not extensively validated across diverse tasks and models.", "The paper does not address potential biases in the selected IT data, which could impact the generalizability of the results."], "suggestions": ["Conduct experiments on larger models to validate the scalability of NAIT.", "Include a broader comparison with existing methods to strengthen the claim of superiority.", "Provide more extensive validation of the interpretability of neuron activation features across diverse tasks and models.", "Address potential biases in the selected IT data to ensure the generalizability of the results."], "rating": 7, "confidence": 4, "soundness": 3, "presentation": 3, "contribution": 3}

